lace de saldo','days after checkout'=>'días después del check-out','Default Send Schedule'=>'Programación de envío predeterminada','Custom Lead Days'=>'Días de anticipación personalizados','Days before the scheduled send date when using custom lead time.'=>'Días previos a la fecha de envío programada cuando se utiliza un plazo de antelación personalizado.','Manual Send Only'=>'Solo envío manual','Your booking at {company_name} - {check_in} - {check_out}'=>'Tu reserva en {company_name} - {check_in} - {check_out}','Your booking at {company_name} is CONFIRMED - {check_in} - {check_out}'=>'Tu reserva en {company_name} está CONFIRMADA - {check_in} - {check_out}','Canceling your booking at {company_name} - {check_in} - {check_out}'=>'Cancelación de tu reserva en {company_name} - {check_in} - {check_out}','Hello {customer_name},\\n\\nThank you for your booking! Your reservation #{booking_id} for {room_name} (Room {room_number}) is now {status}.\\n\\nCheck-in: {check_in} from {check_in_time}\\nCheck-out: {check_out} by {check_out_time}\\nGuests: {guests} Adult(s), {children} Child(ren)\\n\\nIf you have any questions, please don\'t hesitate to contact us.\\n\\nBest regards,\\n{site_name}'=>'Hola, {customer_name}:\\n\\n¡Gracias por tu reserva! Tu reserva #{booking_id} para {room_name} (Habitación {room_number}) está ahora {status}.\\n\\nEntrada: {check_in} desde las {check_in_time}\\nSalida: {check_out} antes de las {check_out_time}\\nHuéspedes: {guests} adulto(s), {children} niño(s)\\n\\nSi tienes alguna pregunta, no dudes en ponerte en contacto con nosotros.\\n\\nUn cordial saludo,\\n{site_name}','Balance Collection Status'=>'Estado de cobro del saldo','Balance Collected Via'=>'Saldo cobrado mediante','Balance Payment Amount'=>'Importe del pago del saldo','Balance Payment Date'=>'Fecha de pago del saldo','Balance Link Sent At'=>'Enlace de saldo enviado el','Urgent Unpaid'=>'Urgente sin pagar','Payment History & Folio Ledger'=>'Historial de pagos y libro mayor de folio','Amount Due Now'=>'Importe vencido ahora','Due Type'=>'Tipo de vencimiento','Additional charges pending payment'=>'Cargos adicionales pendientes de pago','Offline Payment Methods in Payment Requests'=>'Métodos de pago fuera de línea en solicitudes de pago','Could not reach the license server, but your license was last verified %d hour(s) ago and remains active.'=>'No se pudo conectar con el servidor de licencias, pero su licencia se verificó por última vez hace %d hora(s) y sigue activa.','Displays the booking search and reservation form. Use [mhbo_booking_form] or [modern_hotel_booking].'=>'Muestra el formulario de búsqueda y reserva. Usa [mhbo_booking_form] o [modern_hotel_booking].','Displays a grid of room types. Attributes: columns, limit.'=>'Muestra una cuadrícula de tipos de habitación. Atributos: columns, limit.','Displays the availability calendar for a specific room. Attribute: room_id.'=>'Muestra el calendario de disponibilidad de una habitación específica. Atributo: room_id.','Embeds the AI Concierge chat widget. Attributes: variant, position, welcome_message, theme.'=>'Inserta el widget de chat del Asistente Virtual IA. Atributos: variant, position, welcome_message, theme.','Available placeholders: {customer_name}, {customer_email}, {customer_phone}, {site_name}, {booking_id}, {booking_token}, {booking_reference}, {status}, {check_in}, {check_out}, {check_in_time}, {check_out_time}, {nights}, {total_price}, {guests}, {children}, {children_ages}, {children_total}, {room_name}, {room_number}, {custom_fields}, {booking_extras}, {extras}, {extras_text}, {payment_details}, {tax_breakdown}, {tax_breakdown_text}, {tax_total}, {tax_registration_number}, {company_name}, {company_address}, {company_phone}, {company_email}, {company_website}, {company_registration}, {whatsapp_number}, {whatsapp_link}, {view_url}, {special_requests}, {arrival_time}'=>'Marcadores de posición disponibles: {customer_name}, {customer_email}, {customer_phone}, {site_name}, {booking_id}, {bo